ems, at least as best as I could.Decades later — a career, a family, I found Dorfromantik. It taught me nearly the opposite lesson: that a game's challenge","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T15:45:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297346","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4836960-1841579228677026","game_id":"steam-4836960","kind":"announcement","title":"Let's begin with a few green tiles","summary":"Welcome to Cozy Burg.Here, you'll start with nothing at all — a piece of ground, and no particular hurry. Let a little water gather. Soften an edge with trees. Raise a mountain, so the horizon has something to say. Tuck in some homes, a few shops, a farm or two, and watch the little town come alive.And when you put down a pretty road... people find it. Every car after that is somebody going somewhere. Every town asks the same thing of you: keep people coming, before the tiles in your hand run ou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T01:29:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677026","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4836960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:05Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:04Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4836960":"2026-10-20T17:48:05Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4836960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5287620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
